-- Rebrand outgoing email templates: add logo, styled card/button/info-box design,
-- and an internal-staff-only discard notice on the 7 staff-facing templates
-- (the other 4 go to candidates/contractors/supervisors, who are the correct
-- external recipients, so the notice does not apply to them).
-- {{logoUrl}} is substituted centrally by sendTemplatedEmail(), not per-caller.
-- Migration: 20260819000005_email_templates_rebrand.sql

